  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The dimension of momentum is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>From de&nbsp;Broglie equation,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>]</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>The stopping potential is related to maximum kinetic energy of emitted electron as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>e</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>AT</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>From Einstein&#39;s photoelectric equation, the work function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi></math>&nbsp;has dimensions of energy&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#981;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
